Debug mode walks a directory given as `./input/` as the glob view does: an error about a file in it names the file by its path in normal form, `input/broken.md`, as the glob view's would.
== args
--debug
./input/
== file input/broken.md escaped
\xff
== file input/ok.md
# Ok
== stdout
«# Ok»
== stderr
File input/broken.md is not UTF-8 text
== exit 1
